### Create a New User (Signup)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser1@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123",
  "name": "Test User",
  "role": "patient"
}

###

### Login the User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser1@example.com",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}
